    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever, weight change, or night sweats</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No vision change, eye swelling, or double vision</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Nasal blockage most days and reduced smell; no discolored drainage since the antibiotic; no ear pain or hearing change</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain or palpitations</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough, wheeze, or breathlessness on exertion</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No diarrhea or abdominal pain after the antibiotic</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Regular periods; no urinary symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No joint pain</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No changing moles or rash</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>Headaches only with the sinus pressure; no weakness or numbness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood good; PHQ-2 0</td></tr><tr><td>Allergic and immunologic</td><td>Negative</td><td>No seasonal itching or sneezing; no frequent infections elsewhere</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>12 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

