    <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.21" extension="2015-08-01"/>
    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 16 minutes, with her consent. Because she flies alone, she wanted to name a health care agent now; the agent is recorded in the confidential part of the chart and not named here. She said that if she were ever badly injured and unable to decide, she would want treatment aimed at recovery, and she would want her agent to decide with the doctors if recovery became very unlikely. She chose not to record more detailed preferences today. To be revisited yearly. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
